<title>JAPAN: Yamaichi Sec says to file libel suits over reports.</title>
<headline>Yamaichi Sec says to file libel suits over reports.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi Securities Co on Monday denied media reports about its business dealings and said it would file libel suits against a Japanese newspaper and a business magazine.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the brokerage said a report on Monday by the Japanese mass daily Sankei Shimbun on the brokerage's past dealings with Hanwa Co Ltd was &quot;totally groundless&quot;.</p>
<p>A Hanwa spokesman said there had been no illegality in the transactions between the company and Yamaichi.</p>
</text>
